","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2012-12-04T22:14:00Z","updated_at":"2012-12-04T22:14:00Z","body":"Hmmm, interesting, it works ok in ANGLE but it behaves as you described in OpenGL. I'll need to investigate.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/11018161/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"alteredq","id":438022,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODAyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/438022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq","html_url":"https://github.com/alteredq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/11096054","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/2742#issuecomment-11096054","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/2742","id":11096054,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDExMDk2MDU0","user":{"login":"alteredq","id":438022,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODAyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/438022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq","html_url":"https://github.com/alteredq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2012-12-06T17:51:21Z","updated_at":"2012-12-06T17:51:21Z","body":"So I had a look and it's weird. It seems to be caused by having zero position vector (setting `light.visible = false` zeroes all light uniforms). \n\nNow the strange part is how differently ANGLE and OpenGL respond to these zeroes:\n- sending zeroes from GL uniforms API in ANGLE makes no problems\n- sending zeroes from GL uniforms API in OpenGL makes whole pixel black (independently of other operations in shader, this is what @mrdoob observed)\n- setting zeros directly in shader in ANGLE makes shader compilation error\n- setting zeroes directly in shader in OpenGL makes no problems\n\nA simple workaround for this particular example is just not setting zeroes to position when the light is disabled, but that still leaves mysterious pixel failure if somebody sets zero position to directional / hemisphere light on purpose.\n\nI'll try to find some workaround.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/11096054/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"alteredq","id":438022,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODAyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/438022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq","html_url":"https://github.com/alteredq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":31375940,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MzEzNzU5NDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/events/31375940","actor":{"login":"mrdoob","id":97088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3MDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/user